{"synopsis":"Ketika Segun Han, seorang remaja berusia 16 tahun yang bermimpi menjadi pembalap motor, pulang ke rumah suatu malam setelah baku tembak dengan para pengendara motor, ia menemukan bahwa orang tua dan kakak laki-lakinya telah dibunuh oleh vampir. Segun menjadi sangat marah dan mulai memburu vampir! Akankah ia menjadi vampir atau mati sebagai manusia? Pertempuran brutal antara vampir dan pemburu vampir terjadi di Seoul!","alternative_title":"Reveries of the Moonlight (2025), Chronicles of the Moonlit Night, Moonlight Chat, Moonlight Conversation, Moonlight Talk, Tales of the Moonlit Night, 월야환담 (2026)","author":"Big Bird, Hong Jung Hoon","artist":"JI Chang-geun","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"1cc3c93a-4ca0-41c9-805c-537368a2b743","number":"30","chapter":"30","title":"","date":"2026-05-02","released":"2026-05-02","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_1/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_2/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_3/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_4/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_5/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_6/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_7/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_8/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_9/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_10/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_11/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_1979c154-8889-413a-9273-af2f63392144/chapter_ch_12